# L §5.16 Closed forms: share(a × X + b op y) with y known; random on both sides has no closed form.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input z: dist
input u01: dist
input u4: dist
input cnt: dist
input q25: num
input two: num
input lvl: num

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  z = normal(0, 1) to 1e-9
  u01 = uniform(0, 1) to 0.001
  u4 = uniform(0, 4) to 0.001
  cnt = binomial(4, 0.5)
  q25 = 0.25
  two = 2
  lvl = 0.5

ask a: share(u01 > u4) law 2026-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-RANDOM ...
